{"title":"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a prime number, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa13febe81592155005aa6d8a405fd0c0b09552b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7p+3^{p}-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> is not a perfect square.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Fermat's Little Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17d835c5f1b1be4d35a667674b7c3ab2cdc553df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7p+3^p-4\\equiv3-4\\equiv-1\\mod p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"265\" height=\"18\" />. By quadratic residues, this is true if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c77ab88fb8707fbf2359895f9b77ee1159d91b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\equiv1\\mod4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" />, except for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/b/25b803838ba4ded99f094071740c256527784b2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> (which doesn't work). Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/20290098410816824cd321b3ee74d3d627212b42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7p+3^p-4\\equiv3+3-4=2\\mod4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"282\" height=\"18\" />, but this implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/405457e6ec3ac664d5937d337cbcfcd2de2a75e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v_2(7p+3^{p}-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" /> is odd, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa13febe81592155005aa6d8a405fd0c0b09552b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7p+3^{p}-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> cannot be a perfect square.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO\" title=\"2007 JBMO\">2007 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017213844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 838/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 42/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1473/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.757      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    6.757      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23662:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017213844 and revision id 218260. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}